; fpmacro 2
; Macro language v2 -- application commands, the manual check
; (docs/handoff/0215-report.md; docs/macro-spec/MACRO_SPEC.md sec 14).
; On an EMPTY plan: Macro > Record / Debug, Load this file, Replay.
;
; 1. four walls, by command -- no mouse is simulated
@WALL 0 0 240 0 ext
@WALL 240 0 240 180 ext
@WALL 240 180 0 180 ext
@WALL 0 180 0 0 ext
; 2. the room is named; a quoted argument keeps its space
@ROOM "Living Room" 120 90
; 3. a door, with its size given -- no dialog opens
@DOOR 120 0 3680
; 4. a sofa and an armchair, the second placed in feet and inches
@PLACE sofa 120 140 0
@PLACE armchair 4' 6' 90
; 5. commands and input in one macro: a free-angle wall drawn with Shift held
I CLICK 60 90 +DRAG 177 133
; 6. select the sofa and turn it
S @SELECT 120 140
@ROTATE 90
@DESELECT
